# Local-only artifacts — never commit generated projects or captures
*.ocfproj
*.log

# Seeded-error study: the packet definitions and the answer key define a BLIND
# study and must never enter a repository meant to be public. Only the
# obviously-fictional example is tracked.
docs/evidence/pilot-kit/seeded-packets.json
**/FACILITATOR-KEY.md
# Credentials and secrets - NEVER committed, in any form, by any contributor,
# human or automated. The CI scan is a backstop that runs after a commit
# exists; these patterns and the pre-commit hook (tools/install-hooks.ps1)
# are the guard. Extend this list rather than making an exception to it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.publishsettings
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json

# A locally dropped secret scanner, so the hook can find one without a
# system-wide install.
tools/bin/
